  interactionRange: 4
  interactKey: 101
  dialogueLines:
  - I failed. I tried to stop him, but I was too late.
  - But you... you can still make a difference. Take this. Use it to reach the places
    he can't. Reach the truth. Reach the end of this nightmare.
  - Forgive me... I couldn't save anyone. But maybe... maybe you can.
  voiceLines:
